tion\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1300968,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games: Sunrise on the Reaping\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nzIXSQNgYZwFOMrmv0d0I3ulvkM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aqFZcr2dxSZ2UwWSo1WC6C0rwDf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Return to the world of Panem 24 years before Katniss Everdeen volunteers in her sister's place, commencing on the morning of the reaping of the 50th Hunger Games, also known as the Second Quarter Quell.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":969681,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bjiS5ipwxb9JFy3XRRN4OAilSeX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/subj7knTn4DeS6KS7qI66EQKe9i.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn't remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1423191,\"title\":\"Resident Evil\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gAgWJhUSQWCgtKR8170nMkYlBda.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3icyRAqgakNcQn6aDVz9libFmBA.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Medical courier Bryan unwittingly finds himself fighting for survival as one fateful, horrifying night collapses around him in chaos.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":299534,\"title\":\"Avengers: Endgame\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jtDv3lCnST0fZRvdYFwR5CVwK2x.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7RyHsO4yDXtBv1zUU3mTpHeQ0d5.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":157336,\"title\":\"Interstellar\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yQvGrMoipbRoddT0ZR8tPoR7NfX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8sNiAPPYU14PUepFNeSNGUTiHW.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The adventures of a group of explorers who make use of a newly discovered wormhole to surpass the limitations on human space travel and conquer the vast distances involved in an interstellar voyage.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":693134,\"title\":\"Dune: Part Two\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6izwz7rsy95ARzTR3poZ8H6c5pp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eZ239CUp1d6OryZEBPnO2n87gMG.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Follow the mythic journey of Paul Atreides as he unites with Chani and the Fremen while on a path of revenge against the conspirators who destroyed his family. Facing a choice between the love of his life and the fate of the known universe, Paul endeavors to prevent a terrible future only he can foresee.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":460516,\"title\":\"Filosofi Kopi 2: Ben & Jody\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3JCXWQdgepkKxK86drRh8tpViL2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3LeSCM2Xm24xVxv1ofpXTmUH8q7.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After starting their traveling coffee business, friends Ben and Jody reopen their shop in Jakarta, where new opportunities and challenges begin to brew.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5551,\"title\":\"Space Cowboys\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hPzt1bbA1sUDQOl6Vujmyz2hjLN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sUye6BrOjlpoAKRMjcP0YwiUvHW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Frank Corvin, ‘Hawk’ Hawkins, Jerry O'Neill and ‘Tank’ Sullivan were hotdog members of Project Daedalus, the US Air Force's test program for space travel, but their hopes were dashed in 1958 with the formation of NASA and the use of trained chimps. They blackmail their way into orbit when Russia's mysterious ‘Ikon’ communications satellite's orbit begins to degrade and threatens to crash to Earth.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":843843,\"title\":\"Suddenly\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x5Xj72BQVNzk6lREDwNuYt4FLoX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mInqo4SQCjDgN5dDIJDa52UMETl.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ben and Laura are a passionate but volatile couple who embark on a round-the-world sailing adventure to give their relationship a new start. During their trip, they decide to explore a vast deserted island which they discover off the coast of Chile. Caught in a violent storm, they shelter in an abandoned whaling station for the night but wake up the next morning to find their boat has disappeared. Stranded in a hostile environment with no means of communication, dwindling supplies and winter approaching they must work together in a life and death battle for survival, that will challenge their feelings and change their relationship forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5172,\"title\":\"The Astronaut Farmer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/19uGc8wW3Ert1QvMYxvnReQkFMc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l4hWbdxXompHvLIR0bl3m3WromI.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Texan Charles Farmer left the Air Force as a young man to save the family ranch when his dad died. Like most American ranchers, he owes his bank. Unlike most, he's an astrophysicist with a rocket in his barn - one he's built and wants to take into space. It's his dream. The FBI puts him under surveillance when he tries to buy rocket fuel, and the FAA stalls him when he files a flight plan – but Charles is undeterred.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4965,\"title\":\"Impostor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7Uy4JbalP0mEyKnFW2IorQDmbBa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dv4tLF2gISz3w1e9YK3rK1jxpLj.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A top-secret government weapons designer is arrested by a clandestine government organization on suspicion of being a clone created by the hostile alien race wanting to take over Earth.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"Q2UjkMU_ZWQ\",\"name\":\"Returning To Theaters\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"NKYea63tQmI\",\"name\":\"Final Sneak Peak\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"P0XN3-n-2Lo\",\"name\":\"Final Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}